+## `glob` Collector
+
+The `glob` collector finds all files matching the provided glob pattern.
+
+```yaml
+deptrac:
+  layers:
+    - name: Repositories
+      collectors:
+        - type: glob
+          value: src/Modules/**/Repository
+```
+
